      url={https://blog.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-os/},
      note={Blog survey 2026-08-07. Second industry co-genesis point after Buzz, from the
            security side. Headline mechanism: observation provenance — every resource an
            agent has seen is recorded, stays attached to derived artifacts, and gates both
            onward sharing (viewer checked against underlying observed resources) and
            outbound action. A basis record serving flow-control verdicts where Sigma serves
            premise verdicts. Corroborates the capabilities fold: agents start at zero
            access, resources arrive as typed capability bindings, ocap RPC (Cap'n Web),
            no ambient authority. Gatekeepers = gates + boundaries at the service seam.
            Stops short of coherence books: collaboration is live shared state or a
            blueprint copy — no basis-carried writes, no adjudication, no currency ledger.},
}

@misc{lettacontextrepos2026,
      title={Context Repositories: Git-Based Memory for Agents},
      author={{Letta}},
      year={2026},
      url={https://www.letta.com/blog/context-repositories/},
      note={Blog survey 2026-08-08 (post of 2026-02-12). Third co-genesis point, from the
            memory side: agent memory rebuilt as a git repository — every change versioned,
            filetree as progressive disclosure, subagent "memory swarms" writing
            concurrently in isolated worktrees and merging back. Independently rediscovers
            trunk + branch + workspace for N=1 memory, and validates the training-priors
            bet: plain files and git verbs are the interface agents already know. Stops
            exactly where Sigma begins: reconciliation is git conflict resolution — line
            grain, no basis, no premise check — and single-tenant, so no audiences, books,
            or standing.},
